"""Equipment part 1: the holsters, the models' places, save / load

Run: set MUT_HARNESS=equipment, MUT_EXTRA_SRCS=ls3df/src/math/math.cpp, MUT_EXTRA_INC=ls3df/src, then
python _re/harness/mutrun.py _re/harness/equipment/mutations/mutate_equipment1.py WORK [JOBS]. The save round trip
needs the original's save (EQUIPMENT_SAVE, see _re/COVERAGE.md).
Generated by _re/harness/shots/gen_mutations.py (lines unique in the file).

Result (2026-11-10): 318 mutants; 290 killed, 19 not building, 9 survived:
- 226 del / num (Clear's m_longGunLift = 0): the lift isn't saved; only Update reads it (part 2).
- 353 cmp / num (model->set >= 0): no model in g_holsterModels has set 0 (they are -1 or 1..9), so
  >= 0, > 0 and >= 1 select the same models.
- 362 cmp / num (the cap of 4 frames a slot): no slot has more than 3 dummies in g_holsterDummies.
- 1026 cmp (itemCount / perFrame < frameCount, as <=): the loop's own check per frame shows nothing more.
- 1829 num (int value = 0, as 1): every case reads the value before using it.
- 1916 num (the name buffer of 1000, as 1001): the same for any name the game saves.
First run: 210 killed, 89 survived. The tests added since cover Clear's defaults (a second load of an empty
chunk), the holsters hidden, released and set up again, the light level, the pouch past its frames, the special
object found by its saved name, the actors and uids 0 / -1, models saved as none, the updates, and the long gun
hidden by the movement's A30 or state 0x5F.
"""
